					<xs:documentation>Indicates the amount to be presented if the money is transferred to or reversed from an account; otherwise the amount is not presented in the message.
CR: Credit
DB: Debit</xs:documentation>
				</xs:annotation>
			</xs:element>
			<xs:element name="Charge" type="xs:string" minOccurs="0">
				<xs:annotation>
					<xs:documentation>Indicates the commission charged for a transaction.
CH: Charge
CM: Commission
TX: Tax</xs:documentation>
